OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up operation begins on
OL,4,Afire-hit Birmingham street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up operation has begun on a
OL,7,Fstreet where fire destroyed homes a
OL,8,Fweek ago and ravaged the gardens of
OL,9,Fother properties.
OL,11,FSix homes on Gorleston Road in
OL,12,FWarstock, Birmingham, were burnt down
OL,13,Fwhen flames broke out across the West
OL,14,FMidlands last Thursday during hot
OL,15,Fweather.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
