OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up operation begins on
OL,4,Afire-hit Birmingham street
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of gardens backing on to
OL,7,Fcouncil-owned Daisy Farm Park were also
OL,8,Faffected, raising fears of burlglaries
OL,9,Fdue to a loss of boundary fencing, with
OL,10,Fresidents reporting that unwanted
OL,11,Fvisitors had wandered on to the
OL,12,Fscorched plots to take photographs.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
