OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up operation begins on
OL,4,Afire-hit Birmingham street
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living on the street, which has
OL,7,Fa mix of privately-owned and
OL,8,Fcouncil-leased properties, have since
OL,9,Freported a flurry of activity by the
OL,10,Flocal authority, although some have
OL,11,Fcontinued to express fears over space
OL,12,Fbetween the back of where they live and
OL,13,Fthe park. The city council said
OL,14,Foperations would include securing its
OL,15,Fproperties with fencing.
